WEBVTT

01:47.941 --> 01:51.236
This outfit isn't gonna work.

01:52.612 --> 01:55.156
We've been expecting you, Mr. Hanma.

01:55.782 --> 01:59.160
We have a private room ready for you.
This way, please.

02:09.462 --> 02:10.588
<i>It's bitter.</i>

02:10.672 --> 02:15.176
<i>Just why does espresso coffee
have to be this bitter?</i>

02:16.761 --> 02:20.682
<i>It was bitter, and then...
an even more bitter conversation began.</i>

02:21.391 --> 02:23.434
Why are you asking that now?

02:25.145 --> 02:26.020
"Why"?

02:27.063 --> 02:29.440
Because I really want to know.

02:30.275 --> 02:31.693
Is it really so strange?

02:31.776 --> 02:34.946
Is it so strange to want to know
why my father killed my mother?

02:35.697 --> 02:37.448
I've never once asked before.

02:37.532 --> 02:40.952
Why? Why did you kill Mom, Dad?

02:43.288 --> 02:45.748
Certain lines should not be crossed

02:45.832 --> 02:48.209
with the comprehension level
of a bratty child.

02:48.793 --> 02:50.712
Know your place.

02:51.296 --> 02:53.715
As her son, it's my right to know.

03:02.307 --> 03:06.978
So, Dad, what do I gotta do
to get you to tell me?

03:10.398 --> 03:11.733
So, Dad...

03:13.902 --> 03:15.236
Excuse me.

03:17.906 --> 03:21.492
<i>The restaurant manager,
Mitsuo Nonaka, who was serving them,</i>

03:21.576 --> 03:23.786
<i>later recounted...</i>

03:24.579 --> 03:27.749
<i>I will never forget the sight.</i>

03:27.832 --> 03:30.585
<i>A sight so frightening,
I doubted my own eyes.</i>

03:31.252 --> 03:33.004
Do I have to do this?

03:33.087 --> 03:35.256
Why... you...

03:35.340 --> 03:36.549
Or more

03:37.926 --> 03:39.177
like this?

03:52.857 --> 03:54.192
An earthquake!

03:54.275 --> 03:55.276
It's a big one!

03:57.904 --> 03:59.781
<i>It was a mysterious sight.</i>

04:00.406 --> 04:04.077
<i>Those two were the only things
that weren't shaking.</i>

04:21.135 --> 04:23.263
Granted, you are insolent,

04:23.346 --> 04:27.558
but even you should know
what it means to lay a hand on me.

04:28.226 --> 04:29.435
Lay a hand on you?

04:32.397 --> 04:35.191
Come on, that was nothing.

04:36.276 --> 04:39.445
I never expected it to work on you.

04:40.321 --> 04:44.575
I mean, to the amazing Ogre,
a <i>tachi-shime</i> grab is mere horseplay.

04:45.868 --> 04:50.790
I hear that you're calling the match
between us a father-son fight.

04:52.709 --> 04:53.960
You don't want me to?

04:54.043 --> 04:54.877
No.

04:59.549 --> 05:00.842
That's just fine.

05:04.470 --> 05:05.346
Baki...

05:07.432 --> 05:09.350
Attention!

05:29.454 --> 05:32.123
You spanked me!

05:35.043 --> 05:35.877
Baki...

05:38.379 --> 05:41.466
<i>For four years, he'd longed
for this showdown with his father.</i>

05:43.134 --> 05:44.802
<i>Yet the young man struggled.</i>

05:45.511 --> 05:46.346
<i>But with what?</i>

05:48.431 --> 05:51.225
<i>He wanted to back away. To run away.</i>

05:51.309 --> 05:52.643
<i>To escape.</i>

05:53.227 --> 05:54.896
<i>At his father's command,</i>

05:54.979 --> 05:57.648
<i>he couldn't help but stand at attention.</i>

05:58.608 --> 06:02.653
<i>When his father stepped close,
he couldn't help but take flight.</i>

06:03.905 --> 06:07.784
<i>Then came the inhuman impact.</i>

06:09.077 --> 06:10.411
<i>As he flew through the air.</i>

06:11.412 --> 06:12.372
<i>As he flew outside.</i>

06:13.706 --> 06:14.916
<i>As he protected himself.</i>

06:16.000 --> 06:18.419
<i>He inevitably came to a deep realization.</i>

06:19.504 --> 06:21.214
<i>He's on a completely different level!</i>

06:27.512 --> 06:29.472
It is not your fault.

06:30.598 --> 06:32.433
It's not your fault, but

06:33.309 --> 06:37.313
it's the fault of this hand
that grabbed your father's neck.

06:46.280 --> 06:47.573
You bastard.

06:50.660 --> 06:53.121
<i>The young man was beginning to understand.</i>

06:53.204 --> 06:55.331
<i>His father wasn't aiming
for his vital spots.</i>

06:58.167 --> 06:59.585
<i>So this wasn't a fight.</i>

06:59.669 --> 07:01.963
<i>This was discipline.</i>

07:03.548 --> 07:06.259
It seems you haven't done
enough reflecting.

07:11.055 --> 07:12.473
You think he's okay?

07:17.437 --> 07:21.566
Sorry for interrupting your dinner, everyone.

07:22.567 --> 07:25.486
As you can see, I am disciplining this

07:27.071 --> 07:28.489
insolent son of mine.

07:31.576 --> 07:32.493
Whoa! No way!

07:32.577 --> 07:35.580
I am educating him now.

07:38.749 --> 07:42.086
Parent and child. Father and son.

07:46.466 --> 07:49.302
A relationship that invites conflict
again and again.

07:49.844 --> 07:51.929
The son who tries to overcome his father.

07:52.013 --> 07:54.265
The father who won't allow himself
to be overcome.

07:55.308 --> 07:57.226
Such a joy, isn't it?

07:59.437 --> 08:01.772
Such a joy, isn't it?

08:02.356 --> 08:04.484
Such a joy, isn't it?

08:10.156 --> 08:12.116
Such joy!

08:15.286 --> 08:16.579
That's a person!

08:17.246 --> 08:21.167
<i>What the hell are you doing?!</i>

08:22.001 --> 08:23.461
<i>A murder suicide?!</i>

08:23.544 --> 08:26.422
<i>No! He'd never do that! I'm certain!</i>

08:27.840 --> 08:32.136
<i>This guy's the least likely type
to kill himself!</i>

08:32.970 --> 08:36.349
Baki, prepare for landing.

08:37.767 --> 08:39.936
<i>Landing?!</i>

08:58.246 --> 09:02.625
<i>Is it even possible to land on a target
when jumping from a high-rise building?</i>

09:03.626 --> 09:08.214
<i>Master Sergeant Akio Kamura, age 53,
with the Airborne Training Unit</i>

09:08.297 --> 09:11.509
<i>of the 1st Airborne Brigade
of the Ground Self Defense Force,</i>

09:12.343 --> 09:15.763
<i>who has made 345 jumps, had this to say.</i>

09:16.722 --> 09:19.934
You need distance, height.

09:21.185 --> 09:26.899
For example, if you assume
the proper posture at 3,000 meters,

09:27.692 --> 09:31.404
you could move
around 1,000 meters in 60 seconds.

09:32.196 --> 09:36.534
Therefore, if you're over 150 meters up

09:37.076 --> 09:41.080
and you're aiming to hit a car
in a parking lot below you,

09:41.163 --> 09:42.498
it may be possible.

09:43.708 --> 09:47.044
<i>There have only been
a few instances in the past</i>

09:47.712 --> 09:52.466
<i>when a person was saved from falling off
a high-rise by landing on a vehicle.</i>

09:53.134 --> 09:54.260
<i>But even so...</i>

09:58.806 --> 09:59.932
He's alive.

10:06.772 --> 10:09.692
These luxury cars may be useless

10:10.693 --> 10:13.446
but they make a pretty good cushion
at times like this.

10:20.828 --> 10:24.707
Okay. We've eaten. We've drunk our tea.

10:27.752 --> 10:29.170
Quit being a baby.

10:30.296 --> 10:33.215
You can't possibly be done
after just this!

10:36.802 --> 10:39.722
Get me up. I can't move.

10:40.723 --> 10:41.682
Get me up.

10:52.902 --> 10:56.030
<i>A left handshake symbolizes
the end of a relationship.</i>

10:56.113 --> 10:59.283
<i>Even so, he took his father's kindness
and turned it against him</i>

10:59.367 --> 11:01.452
<i>with a blatant surprise attack.</i>

11:02.578 --> 11:04.205
<i>It was an unfair act.</i>

11:04.288 --> 11:07.792
<i>And the feelings that flickered
through the son's heart...</i>

11:07.875 --> 11:11.504
<i>Was it remorse? Self-consciousness?
Guilt? Accomplishment?</i>

11:12.838 --> 11:16.759
<i>There was no time to think about
what he'd gained or what he'd lost.</i>

11:18.427 --> 11:22.973
<i>The image that involuntarily sprung up
in the son's mind was... this.</i>

11:24.684 --> 11:29.355
<i>An enormous and eternal stone,
constantly battered by wind and rain.</i>

11:31.565 --> 11:33.943
<i>The rounded surface had luster,</i>

11:35.027 --> 11:38.447
<i>and was covered
in a one-centimeter layer of rubber.</i>

11:39.365 --> 11:43.285
<i>That is what he struck with the palm
of his hand with all his might.</i>

11:44.954 --> 11:47.498
<i>A multitude of images
rushed him in an instant,</i>

11:48.749 --> 11:52.253
<i>most of which were grave and hopeless.</i>

11:52.878 --> 11:57.800
Why you... insolent bastard!

12:02.138 --> 12:04.807
Apprehend him!

12:09.019 --> 12:10.104
Stop!

12:37.923 --> 12:42.595
You're just a brat, but you purposely
avoided vital spots and hit open-handed.

12:43.304 --> 12:47.183
The price for going easy on Yujiro...

12:52.354 --> 12:53.773
It'll cost you.

12:55.191 --> 12:56.317
You think you have it?

12:57.151 --> 12:58.611
You think you have the right...

13:01.197 --> 13:03.115
to go easy on me?

13:06.786 --> 13:08.496
Do you have that right, you bastard?!

13:12.708 --> 13:15.127
Answer me!

13:18.964 --> 13:22.384
That hurts, you son-of-a-bitch!

13:24.887 --> 13:27.389
This is going to be a long night.

13:27.973 --> 13:30.142
<i>That's right, Dad.</i>

13:30.643 --> 13:32.394
<i>I don't have to answer you.</i>

13:33.062 --> 13:35.439
<i>This isn't a battle.</i>

13:38.984 --> 13:41.153
<i>As long as it's the two of us facing off,</i>

13:41.862 --> 13:43.906
<i>then it's a father-son fight
no matter what.</i>

13:45.908 --> 13:48.911
<i>So I'm not gonna aim for vital points.</i>

13:48.994 --> 13:50.246
<i>Backspin!</i>

13:50.746 --> 13:53.415
<i>In a father-son fight,
we're not trying to deal damage...</i>

13:56.085 --> 13:58.170
You're such an unreasonable brat.

14:03.259 --> 14:08.138
<i>We may not be aiming for vital points,</i>

14:09.682 --> 14:12.560
<i>and may not be trying to deal damage...</i>

14:15.521 --> 14:17.773
<i>I'm still fighting Yujiro Hanma.</i>

14:18.274 --> 14:22.570
<i>My dad's first proper strike
in four years, nearly 1,500 days.</i>

14:22.653 --> 14:24.655
<i>He may be avoiding vital areas</i>, <i>but...</i>

14:26.657 --> 14:29.577
<i>In that moment, he felt powerless.</i>

14:29.660 --> 14:32.872
<i>The difference between him
and his father, Yujiro, was much too big.</i>

14:43.549 --> 14:46.468
Right away! This very instant!

15:01.692 --> 15:05.988
Even if your brain's a pile of shit,
your body is quick to repent.

15:08.741 --> 15:12.745
This move was once looked down on
since it was used by women and children.

15:14.872 --> 15:16.790
<i>He's gonna do it! He's gonna do that!</i>

15:19.627 --> 15:22.254
This is the perfect time for it.

15:23.047 --> 15:27.092
Its lethality is low,
but the pain it causes is massive.

15:31.472 --> 15:32.431
The Whip Strike.

15:35.017 --> 15:36.644
Then do it.

15:36.727 --> 15:38.771
The move used by women and children.

15:39.355 --> 15:42.358
<i>What'll a Whip Strike
from Yujiro Hanma be like?</i>

15:42.858 --> 15:44.109
<i>What'll it be like?</i>

15:47.905 --> 15:51.867
<i>The blow Baki received was unlike
any he'd ever received before.</i>

15:53.160 --> 15:56.872
<i>The few moments that should've been spent
counterattacking his father</i>

15:56.956 --> 15:59.083
<i>could now only be spent
on bracing himself.</i>

16:00.709 --> 16:01.627
<i>And then...</i>

16:02.878 --> 16:04.797
Ow!

16:09.385 --> 16:12.805
<i>It hurts, it hurts...</i>

16:12.888 --> 16:14.056
<i>It hurts!</i>

16:14.139 --> 16:16.141
This isn't entirely useless.

16:27.277 --> 16:30.197
That's the second time
you've stood at attention today.

16:42.126 --> 16:44.795
<i>His body that he thought
he'd toughened and honed...</i>

16:47.339 --> 16:50.217
<i>was completely betrayed
by its lack of resistance to pain.</i>

16:51.260 --> 16:53.303
<i>It was like a steel whip.</i>

16:54.555 --> 16:57.933
<i>Its target was the human body's
largest organ, the skin.</i>

16:58.642 --> 17:00.728
<i>It's impossible to protect it completely.</i>

17:01.311 --> 17:03.313
<i>He had no choice but to use it.</i>

17:03.397 --> 17:07.234
<i>Self-defense used by women and children
that his father had taught him.</i>

17:07.317 --> 17:09.570
<i>Feel the pain, dammit!</i>

17:12.823 --> 17:15.784
<i>Feel the pain, dammit!</i>

17:15.868 --> 17:19.747
<i>Feel the pain, dammit!</i>

17:20.330 --> 17:23.000
<i>That pain is tough to tolerate.</i>

17:23.542 --> 17:28.756
<i>Enter the realm of oblivion
where you forget everything.</i>

17:40.225 --> 17:42.644
<i>It was no surprise
the young man was shocked.</i>

17:43.479 --> 17:47.024
<i>The sudden transformation in his father
made it look as if he had been flayed.</i>

17:48.192 --> 17:50.027
<i>It's quite simple to understand.</i>

17:51.153 --> 17:52.988
<i>Let's say you slap your right hand.</i>

17:53.614 --> 17:56.283
<i>You then slap your left
in order to reduce the pain.</i>

17:57.951 --> 18:00.120
<i>He was dispersing the pain
from the Whip Strike.</i>

18:01.371 --> 18:03.040
<i>His eyes were bulged.</i>

18:03.749 --> 18:04.875
<i>His teeth gritted.</i>

18:05.876 --> 18:07.795
<i>His fists clenched with all his might</i>

18:08.545 --> 18:10.798
<i>and then opened
with the same great strength.</i>

18:10.881 --> 18:13.717
<i>He straightened his arms
with all his might,</i>

18:13.801 --> 18:15.803
<i>flexed them with the same strength.</i>

18:15.886 --> 18:20.307
<i>He put down his legs with all his might,
then lifted them up with all his might.</i>

18:21.308 --> 18:22.810
<i>His belly caved.</i>

18:23.644 --> 18:25.312
<i>His hips tilted.</i>

18:26.063 --> 18:27.648
<i>His chest tightened.</i>

18:28.899 --> 18:30.400
<i>His back tensed.</i>

18:31.735 --> 18:35.781
<i>He resisted relaxing any part of his body.</i>

18:35.864 --> 18:36.698
<i>In other words...</i>

18:37.366 --> 18:42.913
<i>Yes, he simultaneously flexed
every fiber of muscle while holding still.</i>

18:44.915 --> 18:47.376
<i>Thanks to the pain
from flexing his whole body at once,</i>

18:47.459 --> 18:49.294
<i>he dispersed the pain from his skin.</i>

18:49.962 --> 18:53.340
<i>He was barely able to maintain
his neutral expression.</i>

18:58.053 --> 19:02.516
<i>Didn't it hurt? That pain?!</i>

19:05.310 --> 19:08.730
Foolish for a green brat
not to aim for a vital point.

19:09.690 --> 19:12.693
No matter how boneheaded you may be,

19:12.776 --> 19:15.654
I'm sure that you somewhat understand now.

19:17.406 --> 19:18.615
Come at me!

19:21.410 --> 19:24.121
Come at me as if to avenge a parent!

19:36.258 --> 19:38.135
You don't have to tell me twice.

19:39.011 --> 19:40.512
This is vengeance, after all.

19:41.388 --> 19:45.225
<i>The young man took a fighting pose
for the first time that night.</i>

19:46.226 --> 19:47.811
<i>From an open hand to a fist...</i>

19:48.562 --> 19:50.147
<i>What that change signifies.</i>

19:51.273 --> 19:53.817
<i>Dad's hands are still open.</i>

19:55.402 --> 19:57.237
<i>I've taken up a stance.</i>

19:58.572 --> 19:59.489
<i>No, that's not it.</i>

20:00.157 --> 20:03.243
<i>I didn't choose to take a stance
of my own will.</i>

20:04.244 --> 20:06.538
<i>I was forced into taking a stance.</i>

20:09.416 --> 20:10.626
That's the way.

20:11.293 --> 20:15.672
Like the novice you are,
come at me with everything you've got.

20:16.298 --> 20:18.217
Baki!

20:18.300 --> 20:19.176
Huh?

20:19.760 --> 20:22.679
Give it everything you've got, Baki!

20:23.263 --> 20:24.181
Mitsunari.

20:25.766 --> 20:27.935
Don't you worry.

20:28.018 --> 20:31.688
All the nearby residents and hotel guests

20:31.772 --> 20:36.693
have been evacuated by the military.

20:37.736 --> 20:39.446
Such an energetic old man.

20:39.529 --> 20:44.952
Destroy that Ogre
along with the whole building!

20:45.702 --> 20:46.912
I appreciate it.

20:47.412 --> 20:49.206
I'm not so tense anymore.

20:49.289 --> 20:52.709
<i>For now, I'm just gonna go for it.</i>

21:04.554 --> 21:05.681
No good.

21:06.974 --> 21:08.600
<i>Amazing!</i>

21:09.518 --> 21:13.689
<i>The moment my left straight
was fully outstretched like a solid pole...</i>

21:13.772 --> 21:17.693
<i>He timed it to meet the punch
at the exact moment!</i>

21:19.111 --> 21:20.237
<i>He has me figured out.</i>

21:20.904 --> 21:21.905
That's damn good.

21:22.990 --> 21:25.867
Baki, that was the last time.

21:26.576 --> 21:28.203
<i>He knows I'm lying.</i>

21:28.704 --> 21:30.831
You held back.

21:30.914 --> 21:35.127
I've also held back
in response to your insult.

21:35.210 --> 21:38.880
<i>I have to show him
the real me that's deep inside...</i>

21:39.923 --> 21:41.174
I won't do that again.

21:41.717 --> 21:45.387
<i>That's for sure. What's standing before me</i>

21:45.470 --> 21:50.392
<i>is the personification of strength,
adorned by countless battle achievements.</i>

21:51.435 --> 21:56.356
<i>Of course he could see through
every inch of my abilities in one glance.</i>

21:57.232 --> 21:58.775
Jeez...

22:00.861 --> 22:02.654
Come on, Baki.

22:02.738 --> 22:04.906
That's enough already.

22:05.490 --> 22:09.161
Show your father your true skill.

22:10.912 --> 22:12.998
Let's do this for real.

22:13.874 --> 22:14.916
All right?
